<title>USA: AMBI Inc Q3 March 31 net loss widens.</title>
<headline>AMBI Inc Q3 March 31 net loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>TARRYTOWN, N.Y. 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>(in thousands except per share data)</p>
<p>			  Three Months Ended	Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>				March 31,		   March 31,</p>
<p>			  1997		1996     1997	  1996</p>
<p> Sales		$ 1,614	  $ 3,760   $ 9,712    $ 9,003</p>
<p>Other operating</p>
<p>   revenue		244	    1,157	 711	1,262</p>
<p> Total revenues     1,858	    4,917    10,423     10,265</p>
<p>Gain on sale of</p>
<p>   Aplin &amp; Barrett	0		  0     8,648	    0</p>
<p> Net loss	   (4,503)	    (465)   (3,064)    (2,309)</p>
<p> Loss per share   ( 0.25)	  ( 0.03)   ( 0.17)    ( 0.14)</p>
<p>Average outstanding</p>
<p>   shares	    18,524	   18,839    19,826     18,432</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said Q3 1997 net loss is due to marketing and distribution spending associated with the introduction of Cardia Salt Alternatives and the development of nisin, an antimicrobial compound for colon infections.</p>
<p>The company said 1997 Statements of Operations include the results of operations for Aplin &amp; Barrett Limited through December 11, 1996, while the 1996 Statements of Operations include the results of operations for Aplin &amp; Barrett Limited through March 31, 1996.</p>
</text>
